        <activityName xml:lang="en">Surface treatment, cold impact extrusion, steel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Surface treatment, cold impact extrusion, steel
The reference for surface treatment is 1 kg of metal. As there is a large variation from factory to factory with regard to the LCI, it is advised that in case this dataset becomes important in the results, it has to be investigated further if the rough estimations made are applicable or not. ;
UUID: 1910a2d1-3c7b-3981-9641-44c5013b199f
This dataset encompasses the energy consumption for the surface treatment before cold impact extrusion. Infrastructure is not included since it is thought that this process is an integral part of the impact extrusion dataset where infrastructure is included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1910a2d1-3c7b-3981-9641-44c5013b199f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
